  "@type": "DefinedTerm",
  "alternateName": "Opportunistic macroalgae abundance below adverse nutrient enrichment levels",
  "description": "The abundance of opportunistic macroalgae is not at levels that indicate adverse effects of nutrient enrichment. \nThe threshold values are as follows: (a) in coastal waters, the values set in accordance with Directive 2000/60/EC; (b) should this criterion be relevant for waters beyond coastal waters, values consistent with those for coastal waters under Directive 2000/60/EC. Member States shall establish those values through regional or subregional cooperation.",
